ight]\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak{A}_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak{B}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The quotient carrier, filter congruence, and interpretations of every language\nsymbol are supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3807ab351b0011c6\" href=\"?note=3807ab351b0011c6\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product\">17-df-reduced-product</a>.  This atom introduces only notation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-reduced-product","status":"resolved","id":"3807ab351b0011c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduced-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\neq\\varnothing$，$D$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$，见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product","status":"resolved","id":"3807ab351b0011c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$ (predicate, see [[17-df-reduced-product]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product","status":"resolved","id":"3807ab351b0011c6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor